 027 "SERVICE": six-week live-in residency in Chestertown\, Maryland (USD 7
 \,500 stipend)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 01 Dec 2026 at 17:00 EST.\n\nA community-engaged residen
 cy on Maryland's Eastern Shore. Three artists live and work for six weeks 
 in the Raimond Cultural Center\, a restored historic house\, around the th
 eme SERVICE\, working with local partners For All Seasons\, the Kent Count
 y Food Pantry and Sumner Hall.\n\nOrganisation: Kent Cultural Alliance\nLo
 cation: Raimond Cultural Center\, Chestertown\, Maryland\, USA. Live-in. O
 pen to artists across the US\; international artists only with a visa that
  allows work in the US.\nAward: USD 7\,500 stipend for the six-week sessio
 n\, travel reimbursed up to USD 1\,000\, studio and gallery expenses reimb
 ursed up to USD 1\,500\, and on-site housing with a private en-suite bedro
 om. No application fee.\nDuration: Six weeks\, 14 March to 24 April 2027\n
 \nMore: https://kentculture.org/residency/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugra
 ntdesk&utm_medium=referral
