 ally recognised playwright from outside Minnesota to write a new play\, de
 veloped through workshops at the Playwrights' Center and ending in a publi
 c reading. WHO: playwrights who have had at least two different plays full
 y produced by professional theatres by the time of application.\n\nOrganis
 ation: Playwrights' Center\, funded by the McKnight Foundation\nLocation: 
 Minneapolis\, Minnesota\, USA (workshops and a public reading at the Playw
 rights' Center). RESTRICTED: playwrights living in the United States outsi
 de Minnesota.\nAward: USD 15\,000 commission\, plus up to USD 12\,250 in w
 orkshop funds to develop the play\, including travel and housing. No appli
 cation fee mentioned.\nDuration: 1 July 2027 to 30 June 2028\n\nMore: http
